@startuml
title Vina Bim Shop Detailed Data Platform Architecture - PlantUML View

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 180
left to right direction

actor "Executive Teams\nhourly KPI consumption" as Executive
actor "BI / Livestreaming Teams\nlive operations and reconciliation" as BI

rectangle "Sources and Contracts" as Sources {
  component "Python Generator\nscenario data, synthetic metric events,\nbusiness envelopes" as Generator
  component "JSON Event Envelopes\nevent-time business events\nfor Kafka topics" as JsonEvents
  component "Parquet Table Snapshots\ncheckpointed table state\nfor Bronze batch" as Snapshots
}

rectangle "Ingestion and Event Log" as Ingestion {
  component "Schema Registry\nJSON Schema subjects and\ncompatibility contracts" as SchemaRegistry
  component "Kafka UI\noperator visibility for topics,\npayloads, partitions" as KafkaUI
  queue "Kafka KRaft\ncommerce_events\ncatalog_events\nfulfillment_events\nops_events\ndeal_events" as Kafka
  component "Kafka Connect S3 Sink\nlands replayable JSONL logs\ninto MinIO Bronze" as KafkaConnect
}

rectangle "Realtime Speed Path" as RealtimePath {
  component "Apache Flink\nevent-time enrichment,\nrolling metrics,\nalert candidates" as Flink
  queue "Derived Kafka Topics\nrealtime_commerce_metrics_1m\nrealtime_ops_alerts\nmetric_corrections" as DerivedKafka
}

rectangle "Lakehouse Batch Truth" as BatchTruth {
  database "MinIO Lakehouse\nBronze Parquet snapshots\nBronze JSONL replay logs\nIceberg files and evidence" as MinIO
  component "Apache Spark Batch\nhourly validation,\ndeduplication,\nSilver/Gold writers" as Spark
  database "Apache Iceberg Tables\nSilver/Gold analytical tables\nstored on MinIO object storage" as Iceberg
  database "Postgres Metastore DB\nrelational backing store for\nHive Metastore service" as Postgres
  database "Hive Metastore\ncatalog metadata and table locations,\nnot table data" as Hive
  component "Trino SQL Serving\ncanonical hourly SQL\nover Gold through Hive/Iceberg" as Trino
  database "dbt-DuckDB Parity Oracle\nlocal regression checks\nfor model parity and row counts" as Dbt
}

rectangle "Serving and Consumers" as Serving {
  component "Apache Pinot\nfresh provisional realtime serving\nfor metrics, alerts, dashboards" as Pinot
  database "DuckDB Executive Mart\noptional local KPI mart\nfor offline review" as DuckDB
}

rectangle "Control, Governance, Quality, Evidence" as Governance {
  component "Apache Airflow\nDAG orchestration for batch,\nquality, and metadata ingestion" as Airflow
  component "Great Expectations\nBronze warnings,\nSilver/Gold blocking gates,\nData Docs" as GX
  component "DataHub\nmetadata, table lineage,\ntags, glossary,\nquality metadata" as DataHub
  component "Evidence Package\nhealth, screenshots,\nrow counts, reconciliations,\nlineage proof" as Evidence
}

rectangle "Runtime Surface" as Runtime {
  component "Docker Compose Profiles\ningestion, lakehouse, batch,\nstreaming, serving,\norchestration, governance" as Compose
}

Generator --> JsonEvents : event structs
JsonEvents --> Kafka : JSON envelope events
Generator --> Snapshots : batch snapshots
Snapshots --> MinIO : Bronze table state
Kafka --> KafkaConnect : source topics
KafkaConnect --> MinIO : JSONL replay logs
Kafka --> Flink : raw event stream
Flink --> DerivedKafka : metrics / alerts / corrections
DerivedKafka --> Pinot : consume derived topics
Pinot --> BI : live operations
MinIO --> Spark : read Bronze + replay
Spark --> Iceberg : write Silver/Gold
Hive --> Trino : catalog lookup
Trino --> Executive : official hourly KPIs

SchemaRegistry -[#2e7d32,dashed]-> Kafka : schema contracts
Iceberg -[#7e3ff2,dashed]-> Hive : table registration
Postgres -[#7e3ff2,dashed]-> Hive : metastore DB
Trino -[#7e3ff2,dashed]-> DataHub : table lineage
Airflow -[#c77800,dashed]-> Spark : batch DAG
Airflow -[#c77800,dashed]-> GX : quality DAG
Airflow -[#c77800,dashed]-> DataHub : metadata ingestion DAG
GX -[#2e7d32,dashed]-> DataHub : quality metadata
Flink -[#00838f,dashed]-> MinIO : checkpoints + audit JSONL
Pinot -[#00838f,dashed]-> Evidence : dashboard query outputs
Trino -[#00838f,dashed]-> Evidence : KPI query outputs
DataHub -[#00838f,dashed]-> Evidence : lineage evidence
Iceberg -[#2e7d32,dashed]-> Dbt : row counts + parity
Trino -[#1565c0,dashed]-> DuckDB : Trino Gold snapshot export
DuckDB -[#1565c0,dashed]-> Executive : offline KPI mart
Trino -[#6d6875,dashed]-> BI : historical reconciliation
Compose -[#c77800,dashed]-> KafkaUI : profile runtime

note right of Compose
Operational Endpoints
--
Kafka UI :8084
MinIO Console :9001
Trino :8080
Spark :8085 / :18080
Flink :8086
Pinot :9003 / :8000
Airflow :8082
GX Docs :8088
DataHub :9002
end note

note bottom of Trino
Truth Policy
--
Spark + Iceberg + Trino Gold is official hourly truth.
Pinot is fresh and provisional.
dbt-DuckDB is compatibility evidence.
DuckDB mart is a local snapshot exported from Trino Gold.
end note

note bottom of DataHub
Detailed Coverage
--
Product cards represent deployed Compose service groups.
Example: Pinot includes Zookeeper, controller, broker, and server;
DataHub includes GMS, frontend, actions, Elasticsearch, and system update jobs.
end note

legend right
|= Line Type |= Meaning |
| Solid black | primary business data / query serving |
| Dashed purple | metadata / lineage |
| Dashed amber | orchestration / control |
| Dashed green | validation / quality |
| Dashed cyan | evidence / audit |
| Dashed blue | Trino Gold snapshot export |
| Dashed gray | secondary historical support |
endlegend

@enduml
